<title>Yemen and the Red Sea: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/yemen/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-yemen-2026-11-03T23:33:07.573Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 03 Nov 2026 23:33:07 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Houthis have advanced to within 80 km of Aden and intensified fighting in al-Jawf, where Saudi forces intercepted a drone and a missile. A UN staff member died while in Houthi custody, prompting an investigation. Iran and the United States remain far apart on a deal to end the war while Qatar pushes mediation and Iran negotiators left Qatar as a draft proposal circulated. The conflict caused 918 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dw.com/en/yemen-houthi-clashes-near-taiz-leave-residents-in-a-state-of-panic/a-79836913?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-rdf&quot;&gt;Deutsche Welle&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/11/1168730&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/10/1168703&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMizAFBVV95cUxPalRYN3p3UkoxcmdQWFZuQ2xvU1FaZG0yX25XcTJreldvQmIyeDRCdWVKNVliZ1hHaTNweHpmRXpOWUZSVHRLMVdDVmJTOFdOTHRhOGFFS29HYlU1akVQdTFIdGNydjF2WWM3LXZVLUpOam5WeWxFaW0xMWUtRWhhMXdROWlXVFFuZnExdU5RVjlsRE0yMTBxUDh2bkVkeEk0QkwwU1Jxem50WU9yU3hmUHhvSEJyZ251OWM0cEM3dmJ0TzhaNzZrb1FHc3g?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqgFBVV95cUxQYlRCZUUyWF9VckZ3NWJGbUV2Z3luSldoNGZIVk1zTkN4MEZ1ajdSZm4zYmNLYjhVbU5TQU9yYTU2YVVrSFY3QzNPU21wT2EwVlFlRG9mMGxkeG84RHptSzlsOUw3Zmd6SHRqZGdzM1UxQnpWZlZ4MFJSYTFTZ296c2U1T1NGZFBqd3hnazg3clVMUFJ4SWNzYUtjOVoxY2FHMHpzY3RKZkNudw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://n